    ".PAPA",
    "Game Save Backup File",
    "4.4",
    "File created by Flipline Studios games, which include Papas Cupcakeria, Hot Doggeria, and Burgeria; file contains saved game progress data; data is automatically saved after each level on to the players computer. To load a PAPA file, simply select Load Backup! from the Choose A Slot screen, choose Load.., navigate to your PAPA file, and click Open. NOTE: If your browser deletes cookies then your PAPA file wont be saved. Web Flipline StudiosFree.",
