    ".SII",
    "18 Wheels of Steel: Haulin Truck Definition File",
    "4.3",
    "Data file used by 18 Wheels of Steel: Haulin, a truck driving game; contains properties for a truck, such as the engine class; saved in a plain text format and often altered for creating custom truck configurations. SII files can also contain a list of referenced truck files for the game. For example, the file truck_storage.sii contains the list of truck definition files and can be extended to add new trucks. It is saved in a plaint text format. Windows SCS 18 Wheels of Steel: Haulin.",
    "Windows SCS 18 Wheels of Steel: Haulin.",
