    "Animal Crossing Wild World Pattern File",
    "4.1",
    "Pattern file used by Animal Crossing Wild World (ACWW), a lifestyle-simulation Nintendo DS game that consists of catching bugs, fishing, and performing other tasks in a neighborhood of animals; contains a pattern that appears as grass, beach, flowerbeds, bricks, and other gameplay environment elements. NOTE: PattView can be used to view, edit, and create ACWW files. Windows PattViewFree.",
