    ".BIG",
    "Electronic Arts Game Data File",
    "4.1",
    "Game data format used by Electronic Arts (EA) video games; contains individual assets used by the game and zipped to save space; similar to a.ELF file, but modified and saved in a proprietary EA format; can be imported as a MOD file into certain games to alter the gameplay. Windows Gibbeds DeadRising2 Tools. FinalBIG AssetCacheBuilder (assetcachebuilder.exe) Used by PlayStation hardware.",
