    "4.1",
    "Map file used by Americas Army (AA), a multi-player shooter game released by the US Army; contains a game map, including terrain, buildings, and other objects; used to create and share custom maps. AAO files are stored in the Maps directory of an AA installation. Windows US Army Americas Army. File created by Agenda At Once, a Personal Information Manager (PIM) that helps users manage their To-Do lists; contains tasks, notes, calendars, contacts, deadlines, and percentages complete; used to store personal reminders and organize personal schedules. Windows Dataland Agenda At Once.",
