    "4.0",
    "Theme park design created with Thrillville or Thrillville: Off the Rails; may contain roller-coasters, rides, and other games within the theme park; can be custom designed by the user using the games Build feature. Windows LucasArts Thrillville LucasArts Thrillville: Off the Rails.",
