    "Super Mario Maker World Engine Level",
    "4.0",
    "An SWE file is a level created in Super Mario Maker World Engine, a fan-made Super Mario Maker clone. It can be opened, played, and edited in Super Mario Maker World Engine for Windows or Android. SWE file open in Super Mario Maker World Engine Super Mario Maker World Engine allows gamers to create, play, and share their own Super Mario levels. The game is available only in Spanish. To save a level theyve created, a player can open the Guardar/Cargar menu and select Guardar Nuevo nivel. After entering a level name and clicking Aceptar, Super Mario Maker World Engine saves the players level as an SWE file. You can open an SWE file in Super Mario Maker World Engine (Windows, Android). To do so: Open Super Mario Maker World Engines level creation tool. Open the Guardar/Cargar menu. Select Cargar Un nuevo nivel. Browse to and open your SWE file. Windows Super Mario Maker World Engine for Windows. Android Super Mario Maker World Engine for AndroidFree.",
