    "Game ROM used by emulation software for the Sega 32X, an add-on component for the original Sega Genesis console; stores a copy of the original cartridges data; used for playing older games on the PC. Windows Kega Fusion. Mac Kega Fusion. OpenEmu. Linux Kega FusionFree.",
