    "RollerCoaster Tycoon Track Design File",
    "4.0",
    "Game file used by RollerCoaster Tycoon 2, an amusement park management game; contains a track design and is used for building roller coasters in the games theme parks; includes information such as the track parts, number of cars per train, and colors. Windows Chris Sawyer RollerCoaster Tycoon 2.",
