    ["game_files",
    ".SOE",
    "Star Wars: Shadows of the Empire Save File",
    "4.0",
    "Saved game file used by Star Wars: Shadows of the Empire (SWSOE), a video game for Windows and Nintendo 64; contains game progress data such as player lives, ammunition, and completed missions. SOE files are stored in the subdirectory of the SWSOE installation directory. They are not meant to be edited manually, but the contents can be altered by a hex editor to change data, such as the number of lives you have, in order to cheat in the game. Windows LucasArts Star Wars: Shadows of the Empire —  (Discontinued).",
    "Windows LucasArts Star Wars: Shadows of the Empire —  (Discontinued).",
    "?"],
    ["game_files",
    ".BLOON",
    "Bloons Tower Defense Bloon",
    "4.0",
    "A BLOON file is a game data file used by games in the Bloons Tower Defense series. It contains settings that define a bloons characteristics. For example, BLOON files specify a bloons sprite, health, speed, and status and weapon immunities. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense is a series of tower defense games in which players must place weapon-wielding towers to prevent balloons from escaping a maze. In-game, these balloons are referred to as bloons. Each type of bloon is associated with a BLOON file. This file, which consists of JSON-formatted text, defines the bloons appearance and behavior. For example, red bloons are associated with a file named Red.bloon. All of a games BLOON files are stored in its BloonDefinitions directory. You can open and edit a BLOON file with Microsoft Visual Studio Code (multiplatform) or any other text editor. Bloons Tower Defense modders may want to open and edit BLOON files with BTD Toolbox (Windows), a dedicated BTD modding application. Windows Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. BTD Toolbox. Microsoft Visual Studio Code. Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Any text editor Mac Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. Microsoft Visual Studio Code. Apple TextEdit Included with OS. Any text editor Linux Microsoft Visual Studio Code. Any text editor iOS Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. Android Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. Rhythm Software QuickEdit text editor. Aquamarine Networks Jota Text Editor. Chrome OS Google Chrome Text Included with OS.",
    "Windows Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. BTD Toolbox. Microsoft Visual Studio Code. Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Any text editor. Mac Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. Microsoft Visual Studio Code. Apple TextEdit Included with OS. Any text editor. Linux Microsoft Visual Studio Code. Any text editor. iOS Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. Android Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense 5. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Tower Defense Battles. Ninja Kiwi Bloons Monkey City. Rhythm Software QuickEdit text editor. Aquamarine Networks Jota Text Editor. Chrome OS Google Chrome Text Included with OS.",
    "?"],
