    "Runescape Cache Index File",
    "4.0",
    "Index of cache files created by Runescape, an online multiplayer game; stores data about cache files (e.g.IDX255 and other files) saved by Runescape; index files are typically named main_file_cache.idx0 and should not be opened manually. Windows Jagex Runescape.",
