    "Jazz Jackrabbit 2 Level File",
    "4.0",
    "Custom level designed for Jazz Jackrabbit 2, a 2D sidescroller action game, inspired by Sonic the Hedgehog; created with the Jazz Creation Station (JCS) level editor; may be password-protected. Epic MegaGames is now called Epic Games.. Windows Epic MegaGames Jazz Jackrabbit 2 Mac Epic MegaGames Jazz Jackrabbit 2.",
