    ".SIMS2PACK",
    "Downloaded Sims 2 Package File",
    "3.9",
    "Self-installing package file downloaded from the Internet that contains data used to update The Sims 2; typically used for storing Sims (characters), Residential and Community Lots, and texture data; will install itself when opened if The Sims 2 is installed. Windows Electronic Arts The Sims 2. Sim File Maid 2 —  (Discontinued). Ambertation SimPE. Sims2Pack Clean Installer. Mac Electronic Arts The Sims 2.",
