    ".UT3",
    "Unreal Tournament 3 Map File",
    "3.4",
    "Level map used by Unreal Tournament III (UT3), a 3D first-person shooter game; contains the map layout as well as the location of objects and characters in the map; may be included with the game or custom designed by UT3 players. Windows Epic Games Unreal Tournament 3. Epic Games UnrealEdFree.",
