    "Compressed file created for Splinter Cell Blacklist, a third-person shooter stealth adventure game; contains game configuration data, such as object textures, referenced by the game for each level in Splinter Cell; not meant to be opened. NOTE: Both UMD files and.ASS files contain gameplay data accessed by Splinter Cell Blacklist. Windows Ubisoft Splinter Cell Blacklist.",
