    "Mass Effect 2 Modification File",
    "3.3",
    "File used by various Mass Effect 2 modification tools; contains game content modifications, including character outfits and added weapons; used to insert game mod information into the Mass Effect 2 Coalesced.ini configuration file. Mass Effect 2 is a first person shooter game that takes place in outer space. It uses the Unreal Engine 3 gaming engine, which was created by Epic Games. Windows Mass Effect 2 Coalesced Editor Mass Effect 2 Coalesced.ini Mod Manager.",
