    ".Z2F",
    "Zoo Tycoon 2 Object File",
    "3.3",
    "File used by Zoo Tycoon 2, a video game that allows players to operate zoos; contains data used to display zoo animals, exhibits, and other scenery; typically used to extend game content with additional zoo animals. Z2F files may come with a.DL file when downloaded. Both files should be copied into the Zoo Tycoon 2 installation to add the new content properly. Windows Microsoft Zoo Tycoon 2.",
