    "Game ROM used by emulators for the Game Boy Advance handheld console system; stores a dump of the original cartridge data; used for running Game Boy games on the PC. AGB files are similar to.GBA files, but the .agb file extension is much less commonly used. Windows VisualBoyAdvance. Mac VisualBoyAdvance. Linux VisualBoyAdvanceFree.",
