    "2.0",
    "Color animation file used by Mario Kart Wii and other Nintendo Wii games; contains data referenced by the game to swap out different colors for animations, e.g., when Yoshis egg gets darker before it breaks; typically found within a.BRRES resource package file with other files such as.CHR0,.MDL0, and.PAT0 files. Windows BrawlBoxFree.",
