    "1.8",
    "List of files downloaded by LeechGet, a Windows download manager; serves as a reference and a queue that also stores current and future downloads selected by the user; referenced by LeechGet and should not be opened manually. NOTE: LeechGet has been discontinued but is still available to download. Windows LeechGetFree. File format used by Large Graph Layout, a collection of applications used for making the visualization of large networks and trees tractable; commonly referred to as an edge file and contains coordinates that are saved in a human-readable format. Linux Large Graph LayoutFree.",
