    ".BREFT",
    "Wii Effects File ",
    "1.8",
    "Effects file used by Super Smash Bros. Brawl for the Wii; contains information that describes the appearance of different gameplay effects, such as the texture width and height of fire from falling bombs. BREFT files are located in the effect folder of the game directory along with.BREFF files. Windows BrawlBoxFree.",
