    ".N3D",
    "Super 3D Noahs Ark Data File",
    "1.0",
    "3D model or scene used by games created with Nuclear Glory game development software; saves the 3D image and animation information in a format optimized for use by the game engine; used for saving characters, terrain, and other 3D objects. N3D models can be created in Nuclear Studio 3D scene editing software, and then used in Nuclear Basic, the game programming application. Windows Nuclear Glory Nuclear Studio Nuclear Glory Nuclear Basic. Game data file used by Super 3D Noahs Ark, a Bible-themed version of the original Wolfenstein 3D first-person shooter game; may contain sprites, textures, sounds, maps, and other data; loaded during gameplay. Examples of N3D files include VGADICT.N3D, VGAGRAPH.N3D, VGAHEAD.N3D, GAMEMAPS.N3D, CONFIG.N3D, and SAVEGAM1.N3D. Windows Wisdom Tree Super 3D Noahs Ark.",
